d score, working tracking on every form and call button, and unlimited revisions on copy and design before launch. Leads depend on your market, so we measure them and report back after 30 days.</p></div></details><details><summary>How do I pay?</summary><div><p>The $499 build fee is 50% to start, 50% after you approve it and before launch. Then $349/month beginning at launch for hosting and local SEO. Cancel the monthly plan any time with 30 days' notice.</p></div></details></div>
